    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_spectroom_title">About SpectRoom</string>
    <string name="about_intro_1">SpectRoom is a dating and connection app thoughtfully designed for autistic adults and the broader neurodivergent community.</string>
    <string name="about_intro_2">We believe that everyone deserves a space where communication styles are understood, sensory needs are respected, and individuality is celebrated - without judgment, pressure, or misunderstanding.</string>
    <string name="about_focus_title">SpectRoom focuses on clarity, safety, and comfort.</string>
    <string name="about_focus_body">Our design considers the unique needs of neurodivergent users, such as reduced sensory overload, structured communication, clear boundaries, and personalized support settings. Whether you\'re seeking friendship, dating, or deeper relationships, SpectRoom offers a calm and supportive environment where you can express yourself at your own pace.</string>
    <string name="about_mission_title">Our mission is simple:</string>
    <string name="about_mission_body">Create a meaningful, inclusive space where neurodivergent people can connect authentically - and feel safe while doing so.</string>
    <string name="about_values_title">SpectRoom is built with respect, empathy, and accessibility at its core.</string>
    <string name="about_values_body">You\'re welcome here.</string>
    <string name="about_abashelari_title">About Abashelari Productions</string>
    <string name="about_abashelari_1">Abashelari Productions is an independent technology and creative development studio based in Stockholm.</string>
    <string name="about_abashelari_2">We specialize in crafting thoughtful digital experiences with a focus on accessibility, education, and everyday empowerment. Our work spans mobile apps, interactive tools, and content designed to make life easier, more inclusive, and more enjoyable for users of all backgrounds.</string>
    <string name="about_studio_title">Founded on a passion for innovation and human-centered design, Abashelari Productions develops products that combine technical reliability with emotional intelligence.</string>
    <string name="about_studio_body">We believe in building software that respects users, simplifies complex challenges, and brings real value to people\'s lives.</string>
    <string name="about_closing">From children\'s educational games to community-driven platforms like SpectRoom, our goal is to create meaningful digital products that leave a positive impact - one app at a time.</string>

    <string name="privacy_safety_title">Privacy &amp; Safety</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_intro">Your privacy, comfort, and safety are our highest priorities. Our app is designed to support neurodivergent individuals in a respectful, secure, and transparent way. The following principles explain how we protect your information and how you can stay safe while using our platform.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_1_title">1. Your Data, Your Control</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_1_body">• You choose what personal information to share in your profile.\n\n• Sensitive information-such as accessibility needs, support levels, health-related details, or communication preferences-is always optional.\n\n• You can edit or remove your information at any time in your profile settings.\n\n• You can delete your account at any time, and all associated data will be permanently removed from our servers within a reasonable timeframe.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_2_title">2. How We Use Your Information</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_2_body">We use the information you provide to:\n\n• Create your profile\n• Match you with compatible users\n• Improve your in-app experience\n• Maintain a safe, supportive community\n\nWe never sell your data to third parties.\n\nWe only share your data with trusted service providers who help us operate the app (e.g., secure servers, analytics). These providers follow strict privacy and security standards.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_3_title">3. Protecting Your Safety</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_3_body">We use several measures to keep you safe, including:\n\n• Profile moderation and automated detection of harmful behavior\n• Reporting tools available on every profile and message\n• Optional account verification\n• Internal review of reports and timely action against violations\n\nWe do not tolerate harassment, discrimination, hate speech, or exploitation of any kind.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_4_title">4. Sensitive Information</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_4_body">Because our community includes neurodivergent users and people with accessibility needs, you may choose to share personal details.\n\nIf you do, please remember:\n\n• Sharing is always voluntary\n• You control who can view sensitive sections of your profile\n• Sensitive details are never used for advertising or sold to third parties\n• Use caution when sharing personal information with others.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_5_title">5. Communication &amp; Boundaries</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_5_body">Always communicate at your own pace and comfort level.\n\nWe encourage:\n\n• Clear communication\n• Respect for different communication styles\n• Patience and understanding\n\nIf someone makes you uncomfortable, you can:\n\n• Block the user\n• Report their profile\n• Limit who can contact you in your preferences</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_6_title">6. Meeting in Person</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_6_body">If you decide to meet someone:\n\n• Use a public place\n• Tell a friend or family member where you\'re going\n• Consider using the app\'s check-in feature (if available)\n• Trust your instincts-if something feels wrong, leave immediately\n\nYour safety always comes first.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_7_title">7. Security Measures</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_7_body">We use industry-standard security technologies to protect your information, including:\n\n• Encrypted data transmission\n• Secure password storage\n• Fraud detection systems\n• Continuous security monitoring\n\nIf a data or security issue is ever detected, we will notify you promptly and transparently.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_8_title">8. Your Responsibility</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_8_body">While we work hard to create a safe environment, you also play an important role.\n\nPlease:\n\n• Keep personal details (address, financial info, work details) private\n• Be cautious about sharing photos or videos\n• Report any suspicious or harmful behavior\n\nTogether, we can maintain a respectful and safe community.</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_9_title">9. Contact &amp; Support</string>
    <string name="privacy_safety_section_9_body">If you have any questions about privacy, need to report an issue, or want support:\n\n• In-app Support → Help &amp; Safety\n• Or email us at: spectroom.support@gmail.com\n\nWe are here to help and respond as quickly as possible.</string>

